            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “And you shall take fine flour, and bake twelve cakes of it; two tenths of an ephah shall be in each cake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall set them in two rows, six in a row, upon the table of pure gold. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall put pure frankincense with each row, that it may go with the bread as a memorial portion to be offered by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every sabbath day Aaron shall set it in order before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " continually on behalf of the people of Israel as a covenant for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall be for Aaron and his sons, and they shall eat it in a holy place, since it is for him a most holy portion out of the offerings by fire to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", a perpetual due.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now an Israelite woman's son, whose father was an Egyptian, went out among the people of Israel; and the Israelite woman's son and a man of Israel quarreled in the camp, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the Israelite woman's son blasphemed the Name, and cursed. And they brought him to Moses. His mother's name was Shelomith, the daughter of Dibri, of the tribe of Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they put him in custody, till the will of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " should be declared to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
