              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 19.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 5.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " When a man causes a disfigurement in his neighbor, as he has done it shall be done to him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fracture for fracture, eye for eye, tooth for tooth; as he has disfigured a man, he shall be disfigured. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He who kills a beast shall make it good; and he who kills a man shall be put to death. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
